+                last.reaim_writes ? std::format("wrote the curve on {} call(s) from tick {}: start ({:.1f}, {:.2f}, {:.1f}), velocity ({:.2f}, {:.2f}, {:.2f}) (body y {:.2f}, context y {:.2f}), {} frame(s) left, request time {:.3f} s, landed from {}",
